{"slug":"nets-kevin-durant-putting-in-that-work-this-offseason","postId":74717,"title":"Nets' Kevin Durant Putting In That Work This Offseason","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:image {\"id\":516895,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/usatsi_17145258_168388303_lowres-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-516895\"/><figcaption>USA Today</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Two-time Finals MVP and current Nets forward Kevin Durant requested a trade from Brooklyn, his business manager Rich Kleiman <a href=\"https://www.espn.com/nba/story/_/id/34174171/kevin-durant-requests-trade-brookyn-nets-sources-say\">told ESPN's Adrian Wojnarowski last month</a>. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Also according ESPN, Sean Marks would be working with Durant and representation to find a work best for both sides.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>So far, they haven't found a trade that would work for all parties. So, being the professional that Durant is he goes to the gym to work out with his longtime trainer Adam Harrington.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/tv/CgUaROyJA_0/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"instagram\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-instagram wp-block-embed-instagram\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.instagram.com/tv/CgUaROyJA_0/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>According to Basketball News, The Nets recently parted ways with Harrington.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Speaking of Durant, he was on Twitter and clapped back with as few as four to five words. The trend for Durant has continued recently.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A fan reached out to him, offering help to correct Durant's negative image by highlighting some of his philanthropic work that doesn't get a lot of attention. Durant promptly told the 'kid' to beat it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/KDTrey5/status/1550566108146438145?s=20u0026t=EGdDqUfUb-IcxABiznx9EA\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/KDTrey5/status/1550566108146438145?s=20&amp;t=EGdDqUfUb-IcxABiznx9EA\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/ncorbsn/status/1550567629223600128?s=20u0026t=SD_db0BUA3tc9Ip6vBqr0g\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/ncorbsn/status/1550567629223600128?s=20&amp;t=SD_db0BUA3tc9Ip6vBqr0g\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->","excerpt":"USA Today Two-time Finals MVP and current Nets forward Kevin Durant requested a trade from Brooklyn, his business manager Rich Kleiman told ESPN's Adrian Wojnarowski last month . Also according…","publishedAt":"2022-07-23T05:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2022-07-23T05:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"chad-hughes","displayName":"Chad Hughes"},"categories":[{"slug":"sports","name":"Sports"}],"tags":[{"slug":"brooklyn-nets","name":"Brooklyn Nets"},{"slug":"kevin-durant","name":"Kevin Durant"},{"slug":"landon-buford","name":"Landon Buford"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/usatsi_17145258_168388303_lowres-1024x1024.jpg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/usatsi_17145258_168388303_lowres-1024x1024.jpg"],"readingTimeMin":1,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/nets-kevin-durant-putting-in-that-work-this-offseason/"}